" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"}}}